{"id":"wb-7-312","name":"鄢国故城","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"鄢国故城","text":"鄢国故城是位于河南省许昌市鄢陵县彭店镇古城村一带的古国遗址，城址主体分布于古城、前步、张店、赵家等村及其周围。遗址与古代鄢国、郑国鄢邑及汉魏以来的鄢陵县治有关。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%84%A2%E5%9B%BD%E6%95%85%E5%9F%8E","revisionId":95428215,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95428215","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":null}